  /// shown through IconButton.label
  button "Remove {s.Label}" => "إزالة {s.Label}";
  /// MacroSettings · a description
  /// shown through SettingsPage.description
  description "A reply and the things that go with it, in one move — “Refund on its way” writes the reply, tags the ticket and sets it Pending. Applying one puts it in the reply box; its steps run when you send." => "رد وما يرافقه، بخطوة واحدة: «المبلغ المسترد في الطريق» يكتب الرد، ويضع وسمًا على التذكرة، ويضبطها على «قيد الانتظار». تطبيقه يضعه في مربع الرد؛ وتُنفَّذ خطواته عند الإرسال.";
  /// MacroSettings · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~16 characters
  /// shown through Menu.label
  label "Add a step" => "إضافة خطوة";
  /// MacroSettings · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~23 characters
  /// shown through ReplyBodyEditor.label
  /// beside: "Title", "Category", "Write it as an internal note", "Steps"
  label "Reply (optional)" => "الرد (اختياري)";
  /// MacroSettings · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~40 characters
  /// shown through Checkbox.label
  /// beside: "Title", "Category", "Reply (optional)", "Steps"
  label "Write it as an internal note" => "كتابته كملاحظة داخلية";
  /// MacroSettings · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "Applying it writes its reply into the box; its steps run when the reply is sent." => "تطبيقه يكتب رده في المربع؛ وتُنفَّذ خطواته عند إرسال الرد.";
  /// MacroSettings · text on the page
  /// shown through EmptyState.body
  text "Make one for the answer that always comes with a status change or a tag." => "أنشئ ماكرو للإجابة التي ترافقها دائمًا تغيير في الحالة أو وسم.";
  /// MacroSettings · text on the page
  text "None — it only writes the reply." => "لا شيء، يكتب الرد فقط.";
  /// MacroSettings · text on the page
